## Backend Workflow

### Setup
- `cd backend && npm install && npm run dev`
- Configure `.env` with MongoDB, JWT, SMTP, ADMIN_EMAIL, CLIENT_URL.

### Branching & PRs
- Same conventions as frontend `workflow.mdc`.
- Include Postman/Thunder tests or curl examples in PRs.
- Reference `frontend/PRD.md` and `frontend/UI_UX.md` for scope alignment.

### Testing
- Manual tests for auth, products, orders, analytics endpoints.

### Deployment
- Host on Render/railway; set env vars. Expose `/api/health`.

